<title>JAPAN: Nippon Filing -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Filing -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.82		vs	    7.98</p>
<p> Operating    loss 96    million	  vs	 prft 24 million</p>
<p> Current		6    million	  vs	  149    million</p>
<p> Net		    2    million	  vs	  110    million</p>
<p> EPS		    0.27 yen	  vs	   13.91 yen</p>
<p> Shares		8 million	  vs	   8 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Filing Co Ltd is a file and cabinet maker.</p>
</text>
